prompt.template:
Generate GitHub issue specifications for high-severity recommendations.

Read recommendations from: {{outputPath}}/recommendations.json

Filter recommendations where:
- create_issue == true OR
- priority <= 3 AND estimated_impact == 'high'

For each, create issue spec:
```json
{
  "issues": [
    {
      "title": "[Dashboard] <brief title>",
      "body": "## Problem\n<description>\n\n## Evidence\n- Shape: <shape>\n- Error rate: <rate>%\n- Latency: <ms>ms\n\n## Suggested Fix\n<action description>\n\n## Impact\n<estimated_impact>\n\n---\n*Auto-generated by dashboard improvement loop*",
      "labels": ["dashboard", "auto-generated", "severity-<level>", "shape-<name>"],
      "priority": <number>
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "issues_to_create": <count>,
    "by_severity": {
      "high": <count>,
      "medium": <count>
    }
  }
}
```

Output to: {{outputPath}}/issues-to-create.json
